Who are you? No tail, no scales... A Pristonian?

Yagditha's ambition will destroy our world. I should not have left Arteres behind. She was tortured by Yaten, Yagditha's sister, when she sneaked into the fortress's throne room. We found that Midranda had awakened at the sacred spring of the Sanctuary, where he was recovering. But Arteres was bewitched by Yaten and stole the Legendary Trident of Zairweus, Yagditha's father, which the Pristonians had won in the battles against Yagditha's generals.
Yaten killed General Leusen, who had found the Snow Lady, and revived him under her command with the trident's power.
Arteres and Leusen attacked the surface on Yaten's orders.

Prepare your equipment and come back here.
